  "Description": {
    "Cost": 7084500,
    "UIName": "Ifrit 'Rasasa'",
    "Id": "vehicledef_Ifrit_GAUSS",
    "Name": "Ifrit 'Rasasa'",
    "Details": "Rasasa means 'Bullet' in Arabic. The Ifrit VTOL Strike Craft was designed to intercept and delay armored advances. Reactive armor, a Jet Booster and AMS increase its chances of getting close enough to deploy its pylon-mounted primary payload. The Ifrit Rasasa variant swaps the base model's SRM for a gauss cannon and medium lasers. The inferno and FASCAM bombs are traded for guided missiles for tank hunting. \n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: This unit can not deploy in Lunar biomes.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 9/14 hexes / 270/420 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Reactive Plating\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       155     20\n<b>Left</b>         115     20\n<b>Right</b>       115     20\n<b>Rear</b>         95     20\n\n<b>Total</b>      500    100</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Quick Off The Line</color>",
    "Icon": "NidhoggVTOL"
  },
